    "bleachedEventDetails": "<b>PLEASE NOTE THAT ALL REGISTRATIONS AND SUBMISSIONS ARE DUE BY FRIDAY JUNE 26TH. \n\nPLEASE ENTER THE DIVISION FOR THE STATE/TERRITORY YOU ARE IN.</b>\n\nTeams should submit their entry by uploading the files to a Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox or similar file sharing service, then pasting the public sharing link into a word or notepad file, and uploading against the team in the registration system. Participation Deeds &amp; Mentor Declarations can be uploaded directly into the registration system. \n\nIn your teams submission, ensure you include the teams video, presentation, robot program, participation deed for each team member, mentor declaration and any other files/information you wish to submit.\n\nPlease find the participation deed here:<b> <a href=\"https://www.robocupjunior.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/RoboCup-Junior-Australia-Participation-Deed-v6.pdf\">Click to download participation deed</a></b>\n\nPlease find the mentor declaration here:<b> <a href=\"https://www.robocupjunior.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/RoboCup-Junior-Victoria-Mentor-Declaration-v06.pdf\">Click to download mentor declaration</a></b>",
