    "bleachedEventDetails": "RoboCup Junior Australia and RoboCup Junior ACT are thrilled to announce the return of the Australian National Open Championships to Canberra in 2026!\n\nAfter a record-breaking 2025 here in the nation's capital, we are excited to once again welcome all Australian teams to Canberra for another thrilling conclusion to the 2026 RoboCup Junior Australia Season.\n\nEvent Times and Days:\n\n- Friday 2 October: Team registration, setup and testing (2pm - 5pm)\n- Saturday 3 October: Competition Day 1 - All challenges (8:30am - 5pm)\n- Sunday 4 October: Competition Day 2 - All challenges (8:30am - 4pm)\n\nAll teachers and mentors are strongly encouraged to sign up as volunteers to help the event run as smoothly as possible. No prior RoboCup judging experience necessary.\n\nInformation pack: https://www.robocupjunior.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-RoboCup-Nationals-Information-Pack-1.pdf\n\nVolunteer registration: https://forms.office.com/r/kb8xAjBF8q \n\nFor paying your invoice by credit card (you must email proof of payment to Graham.stock@robocupjunior.org.au): https://square.link/u/9idGlfhL",
